{% apply inky_to_html|inline_css %}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="nl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Reserveringsbevestiging #{{ order_number }}</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #fffaf2;
            color: #34272a;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .email-background { background-color: #fffaf2; padding: 28px 12px; }
        .email-card { background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #eadfd1; }
        .brand-header { background-color: #c62828; border-bottom: 8px solid #a91f24; color: #ffffff; }
        .brand-inner { max-width: 720px; padding: 26px 28px; }
        .brand-name { color: #ffffff; font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 4px; }
        .brand-caption { color: #fff1df; font-size: 13px; margin: 0; }
        .content { padding: 28px; }
        .greeting { color: #34272a; font-size: 21px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 10px; }
        .intro { margin: 0 0 18px; }
        .notice { background-color: #fff1df; border-left: 4px solid #c62828; color: #34272a; margin: 20px 0; padding: 14px 16px; }
        .download-wrap { margin: 24px 0; text-align: center; }
        .download-button { background-color: #dc2626; color: #ffffff !important; display: inline-block; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; padding: 14px 22px; text-decoration: none; }
        .details { border: 1px solid #eadfd1; margin-top: 28px; padding: 18px; }
        .details-title { color: #a91f24; font-size: 17px; margin: 0 0 14px; }
        .order-table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; }
        .order-table th { background-color: #c62828; color: #ffffff; font-size: 12px; padding: 10px 8px; text-align: left; }
        .order-table td { border-bottom: 1px solid #eadfd1; padding: 10px 8px; vertical-align: top; }
        .align-right { text-align: right !important; }
        .summary-row td { border-bottom: 0; padding-bottom: 5px; }
        .total-row td { border-top: 2px solid #c62828; color: #a91f24; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; padding-top: 12px; }
        .help-box { background-color: #fff7eb; border-left: 4px solid #c62828; margin-top: 24px; padding: 16px 18px; }
        .help-box p { margin: 0 0 6px; }
        .help-box p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
        a { color: #b91c1c; }
        .footer { background-color: #34272a; color: #fff1df; font-size: 13px; text-align: center; }
        .footer-inner { max-width: 720px; padding: 20px 28px; }
        .footer p { margin: 0 0 5px; }
        .footer a { color: #ffe0a8; }
        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            .content { padding: 20px 16px; }
            .order-table th, .order-table td { padding: 8px 5px; font-size: 12px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<table class="brand-header" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" role="presentation" bgcolor="#c62828">
    <tr>
        <td align="center">
            <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" role="presentation" style="max-width: 720px;">
                <tr>
                    <td class="brand-inner">
                        <p class="brand-name">Jeugdcircus Il Grigio</p>
                        <p class="brand-caption">Reserveringsbevestiging · #{{ order_number }}</p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>
<container class="email-background">
    <row class="email-card">
        <columns class="content">
            <p class="greeting">{% if customer_name %}Bedankt voor je reservering, {{ customer_name }}!{% else %}Bedankt voor je reservering!{% endif %}</p>
            <p class="intro">Je tickets zijn als PDF bijgevoegd bij deze e-mail. Je kunt ze ook downloaden via de beveiligde link hieronder.</p>

            <div class="notice"><strong>Bewaar je tickets goed.</strong> Elk ticket bevat een unieke QR-code en geeft toegang aan één persoon. Je kunt de QR-code vanaf je telefoon laten scannen.</div>

            <div class="download-wrap">
                <a class="download-button" href="{{ download_url }}">Download je e-tickets</a>
            </div>

            <p class="intro">Controleer je reservering op het aantal tickets en de ticketsoorten. Annuleren is helaas niet mogelijk; je mag tickets wel aan iemand anders overdragen.</p>

            <div class="details">
                <h2 class="details-title">Reservering #{{ order_number }} · {{ order_date|date('d-m-Y') }}</h2>
                <table class="order-table" role="presentation">
                    <thead>
                        <tr><th>Ticket</th><th>Aantal</th><th class="align-right">Prijs</th></tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                    {% for item in order_data.line_items %}
                        <tr>
                            <td>{{ item.name }}</td>
                            <td>{{ item.quantity }}</td>
                            <td class="align-right">€{{ item.total|replace({'.': ','}) }}</td>
                        </tr>
                    {% endfor %}
                        <tr class="summary-row">
                            <td colspan="2">Subtotaal</td>
                            <td class="align-right">€{{ order_subtotal|replace({'.': ','}) }}</td>
                        </tr>
                    {% for coupon in order_data.coupon_lines %}
                        <tr class="summary-row">
                            <td colspan="2">Korting ({{ coupon.code }})</td>
                            <td class="align-right">−€{{ coupon.discount|replace({'.': ','}) }}</td>
                        </tr>
                    {% endfor %}
                        <tr class="summary-row">
                            <td colspan="2">Betaalmethode</td>
                            <td class="align-right">{{ order_data.payment_method_title }}</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="summary-row">
                            <td colspan="2">BTW inbegrepen</td>
                            <td class="align-right">€{{ total_tax|replace({'.': ','}) }}</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="total-row">
                            <td colspan="2">Totaal</td>
                            <td class="align-right">€{{ order_total|replace({'.': ','}) }}</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>

            <div class="help-box">
                <p><strong>Geen e-mail ontvangen of vragen?</strong></p>
                <p>Controleer je spam- of ongewenste map. Neem contact met ons op via <a href="mailto:reserveringen@ilgrigio.nl">reserveringen@ilgrigio.nl</a> of bel tijdens de circusperiode naar <strong>0411 - 62 12 15</strong>.</p>
                <p>Praktische informatie vind je op <a href="http://www.ilgrigio.nl">www.ilgrigio.nl</a>.</p>
            </div>
        </columns>
    </row>
</container>
<table class="footer" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" role="presentation" bgcolor="#34272a">
    <tr>
        <td align="center">
            <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" role="presentation" style="max-width: 720px;">
                <tr>
                    <td class="footer-inner">
                        <p><strong>Bedankt voor je reservering!</strong></p>
                        <p>Stichting Haarens Jeugdcircus Il Grigio · <a href="http://www.ilgrigio.nl">www.ilgrigio.nl</a></p>
                        <p>Dit is een automatische bevestiging. Bewaar deze e-mail voor je administratie.</p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
{% endapply %}
